  <entry>
    <id>tag:dtomkatsu.github.io,2026:hawaii-bill-194-2024-2026/2026-07-27T21:55:08+00:00</id>
    <title>New: Bill 194 (2024-2026) (Hawaiʻi County) — On agenda 2025-02-18</title>
    <updated>2026-07-27T21:55:08+00:00</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://hawaiicounty.granicus.com/AgendaViewer.php?view_id=1&amp;clip_id=3310"/>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AMENDS CHAPTER 25, ARTICLES 1, 2, 4, 5, AND 7, OF THE HAWAIʻI (2022-2024) COUNTY CODE 1983 (2016 EDITION, AS AMENDED), RELATING TO TELECOMMUNICATION ANTENNAS AND TOWERS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Amends the definition of “telecommunication antenna” and adds a definition for “telecommunication tower”, expands plan approval requirements, allows for telecommunication antennas or towers in any zoning district upon approval of the Planning Director, and revises siting, design, and operating regulations to align with State law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Latest action: On agenda 2025-02-18&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://hawaiicounty.granicus.com/AgendaViewer.php?view_id=1&amp;amp;clip_id=3310"&gt;View on the council site&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:dtomkatsu.github.io,2026:hawaii-resolution-1780-2024-2026/2026-07-27T21:55:08+00:00</id>
    <title>New: Resolution 1780 (2024-2026) (Hawaiʻi County) — On agenda 2025-08-06</title>
    <updated>2026-07-27T21:55:08+00:00</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://hawaiicounty.granicus.com/AgendaViewer.php?view_id=1&amp;clip_id=3496"/>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO PROVIDE FOR A LOAN FROM THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA, DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE, TO FINANCE CERTAIN PUBLIC WATER SYSTEM IMPROVEMENTS FOR IKI PLACE, KOHANAIKI HOMESTEADS, NORTH KONA, HAWAI‘I; AUTHORIZES THE EXECUTION OF AN AGREEMENT WITH THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA, DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE, FOR A GRANT FOR COSTS OF SUCH PUBLIC WATER SYSTEM IMPROVEMENTS; AND AUTHORIZES THE MAYOR, THE MANAGER-C&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Authorizes a loan agreement with the USDA not to exceed $275,000 and a grant agreement not to exceed $825,000 to fund a portion of the costs of constructing a public water system for Iki Place, Kohanaiki Homesteads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Latest action: On agenda 2025-08-06&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://hawaiicounty.granicus.com/AgendaViewer.php?view_id=1&amp;amp;clip_id=3496"&gt;View on the council site&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
  </entry>
